cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: pydracor
abstract: >-
  pydracor is a Python package that provides access to the API of DraCor,
  the Drama Corpora Platform (https://dracor.org). The package builds on
  pydracor-base, which is generated from the DraCor API's OpenAPI
  specification with OpenAPI Generator.
